# CODEOWNERS for the company brain.
#
# Two lanes. Day-to-day knowledge (inputs, minutes, decisions as proposed, CRM,
# projects, journal, the log) goes straight to main: `brain sync` pulls, commits
# and pushes. What changes how the company works or how the brain works goes
# through a pull request reviewed by its owner: the paths below.
#
# GitHub enforces this only through pull requests. If you turn on "Require review
# from Code Owners", also allow direct pushes for the people who use the brain,
# or every meeting note will need a pull request. Replace the placeholders.
#
# Used only when the brain is shared on GitHub ("sharing": "github"). A brain
# that lives on one machine ignores this file.

# Contracts and structure: a change here is a decision.
/AGENTS.md                         @{{owner-brain}}
/CLAUDE.md                         @{{owner-brain}}
/CODEOWNERS                        @{{owner-brain}}
/_system/Brain\ Blueprint.md       @{{owner-brain}}
/_system/_tags.md                  @{{owner-brain}}
/_system/object-schema.md          @{{owner-brain}}
/_system/brain.config.json         @{{owner-brain}}
/_system/memory/rules/             @{{owner-brain}}
/_system/automations/              @{{owner-brain}}
/.github/                          @{{owner-brain}}

